{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467/events","html_url":"https://github.com/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467","id":5631913301,"node_id":"I_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAABT7AtVQ","number":467,"title":"x402 on Base mainnet: USDC EIP-712 domain name advertised as \"USDC\" instead of \"USD Coin\"","user":{"login":"crtahlin","id":1554520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTQ1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1554520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin","html_url":"https://github.com/crtahlin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9566294157,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAACOjIQjQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12012983973,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAACzAeWpQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/p1","name":"p1","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"High priority — do next","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12362970136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAAC4OP0GA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/audit-2026-09","name":"audit-2026-09","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Filed from the Sept 2026 gateway audit","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12362970340,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAAC4OP05A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/mainnet-blocker","name":"mainnet-blocker","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"Must be fixed before x402 takes real money on Base mainnet","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12362970517,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAAC4OP1lQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/payments","name":"payments","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"x402 pricing, verification or settlement","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12545839977,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAAC68pTaQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/chain","name":"chain","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"On-chain anchoring, contracts, RPC, wallets","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12545840000,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAAC68pTgA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/integrity","name":"integrity","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Hashes, signatures, notary, verification","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-09-29T14:10:21Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T11:23:26Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T11:19:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Problem.** `app/x402/middleware.py` (the `USDC_TOKEN_METADATA` table, around lines 57-66 on `dev`) advertises `extra.name = \"USDC\"`, version \"2\", for network `base`. The Base mainnet USDC contract's EIP-712 `name()` is `\"USD Coin\"`. `\"USDC\"` is correct only on Base Sepolia.\n\n**Impact.** Clients and facilitators build the EIP-3009 signing and verification domain from `extra`. On `X402_NETWORK=base`, signatures made against the advertised domain don't match the on-chain `DOMAIN_SEPARATOR`, so every mainnet payment fails verification. Nothing is lost, because it fails closed, but mainnet payments can't work. Startup validation (#407) doesn't check this value.\n\n**Evidence.** Read-only calls to Base mainnet USDC:\n- `name()` returns `\"USD Coin\"`, `version()` returns `\"2\"`, and `DOMAIN_SEPARATOR` is `0x02fa72…834f`.\n- The separator computed with `\"USDC\"` on chain 8453 doesn't match it; the one computed with `\"USD Coin\"` does.\n\nFound by the 2026-09 client audits. The CLI has the same bug on its side (swarm_provenance_CLI audit, CLI-001), and both must be fixed together.\n\n**Fix (minimal).**\n- Set `name: \"USD Coin\"` for `base`.\n- Add a test pinning both networks' domain separators to the recorded on-chain values.\n- Optionally, at startup on mainnet, compare the configured domain against the chain.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n- [ ] The `base` metadata uses `\"USD Coin\"`.\n- [ ] A test pins the Base and Base Sepolia separators.","closed_by":{"login":"crtahlin","id":1554520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTQ1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1554520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin","html_url":"https://github.com/crtahlin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}